    "name": "brand-voice-interview",
    "description": "Capture a brand's writing voice and positioning. Say \"set up a brand voice\", \"capture our brand voice\", \"add a brand\", \"set up brand voice for <name>\", or run /founder-os:brand-voice-interview. Different from voice-interview, which captures the OPERATOR's personal voice. This skill captures how a brand the operator runs speaks - separate from how the operator speaks. Writes brands/<slug>/voice.yml and brands/<slug>/positioning.yml. Supports operators who run an ecosystem of brands - this skill can be run once per brand.\n",
